Backport of the 15.x security fixes to webonyx/graphql-php v14.11.10.

- GHSA-r7cg-qjjm-xhqq: parser recursion depth limit (upstream 7b7f208, 6c1d600)
- GHSA-fc86-6rv6-2jpm: comparison budget in OverlappingFieldsCanBeMerged (upstream 996adcf)
- GHSA-68jq-c3rv-pcrr (CVE-2026-40476): deduplicate repeated fields in OverlappingFieldsCanBeMerged (upstream b5e7c99)

Drop this patch once drupal/graphql allows graphql-php >= 15.32.3.

